==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{prefix|osteo|arthritis|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|osteoarthritides}}

# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} A form of [[arthritis]], affecting mainly older people, caused by chronic degeneration of the [[cartilage]] and [[synovial membrane]] of the joints, leading to pain and stiffness.

